WEBVTT

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:02.376
The premise behind the Mystery
Magic Box was the following:

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:06.160
15 dollars buys you
50 dollars worth of magic.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.296
Which is a savings.

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:10.176
(Laughter)

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.616
Now, I bought this decades ago
and I'm not kidding.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:15.256
If you look at this,
you'll see it's never been opened.

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:17.416
But I've had this forever.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:18.776
Now, I was looking at this,

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.216
it was in my office,
as it always is, on the shelf,

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:24.616
and I was thinking,
why have I not opened this?

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:25.880
And why have I kept it?

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:27.976
Because I'm not a pack rat.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.216
I don't keep everything,

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.416
but for some reason
I haven't opened this box.